    "biography": "<h2>Druid — Build Guide</h2>\n<p><em>Core Rulebook v3 Alpha 3, Appendix C. This Hero is built at Level 1 with no Ancestry — pick one, rename the Hero, and adjust anything you like.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Bought with the Starting Pack's silver:</strong> Trinket (50s), Medium Armor (1g).</p>\n<p><em>The build's gear costs 45s more than the Starting Pack's money; it starts with no coins left.</em></p>\n<h3>Stats at Level 10</h3>\n<p><strong>MIT</strong> 7 · <strong>DEX</strong> 6 · <strong>AWR</strong> 7 · <strong>RSN</strong> 4 · <strong>PRS</strong> 4 · <strong>LUK</strong> 3</p>\n<h3>Perks by Level</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>1st:</strong> Shapechanger, Snareroot Trapper <em>(already on this sheet)</em></li>\n<li><strong>3rd:</strong> Sixth Sense</li>\n<li><strong>5th:</strong> Tough</li>\n<li><strong>7th:</strong> Cross Counter</li>\n<li><strong>9th:</strong> Heightened Cognition</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Spells</h3><p>Polymorph, Sprout; get Life, Terraform, and Ward later.</p>",
