        "description": "<p><strong>Why do birds suddenly appear, every time you are near?</strong></p><p><em>—Karen Carpenter, Close to You</em></p><p>Keepers of the wilderness, druids are mystics of nature that are adopted into beast-kind.</p><h3>Iconic Druids</h3><ul><li><strong>Beast Boy</strong>, <em>DC Comics</em></li><li><strong>Beorn</strong>, <em>The Lord of the Rings</em></li><li><strong>Frank Zhang</strong>, <em>Percy Jackson</em></li><li><strong>Panne</strong>, <em>Fire Emblem Awakening</em></li></ul><h3>Playing Druid</h3><p>The druid is a mid-defense, mixed support and control class with a focus on Casting Spells and shapechanging to powerful beasts.</p><p><strong>Action:</strong> Cast or Beast Attacks<br /><strong>Move:</strong> Midline<br /><strong>Starting Pack:</strong> Hermit<br /><strong>Key Stat:</strong> Awareness<br /><strong>Complexity:</strong> ★★★☆☆<br /><strong>Training:</strong> Mysticism, Survival</p><h3>Class Features</h3><table class=\"NormalTable\"><tbody><tr><td><p><strong>Level</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Features</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Spells</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Mana</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Cast Max</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>1st</p></td><td><p>Primal Mystic, Feral Shift</p></td><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>2</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>2nd</p></td><td><p>Savagery (+1)</p></td><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>2</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>3rd</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>3</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>4th</p></td><td><p>Tempest Within (1)</p></td><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>8</p></td><td><p>3</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>5th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>10</p></td><td><p>4</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>6th</p></td><td><p>Savagery (+2), Beast Mode</p></td><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>12</p></td><td><p>4</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>7th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>14</p></td><td><p>5</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>8th</p></td><td><p>Tempest Within (2)</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>16</p></td><td><p>5</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>9th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>18</p></td><td><p>6</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>10th</p></td><td><p>Savagery (+3), Force of Nature</p></td><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>20</p></td><td><p>6</p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
